<ResourceDictionary xmlns="https://github.com/avaloniaui"
                    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml">
    <!--
        The icons the app draws, as geometry rather than as a font or a package.

        They are the Regular 24px weights of Microsoft's Fluent System Icons (MIT) — the same family the WPF build
        drew through WPF-UI, so nothing changed shape when the toolkit did. They are inlined for two reasons: ten
        glyphs used seventeen times do not earn a dependency, and an icon font is one more native asset that has to
        survive single-file publishing on two operating systems.

        Each is a 24x24 filled path. Use them through Controls/Icon.axaml, never by referencing a key directly, so
        that size and colour stay in one place.
    -->
